      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "\u20227 of 9 patients with GGE reduced ≥ 50% their tonic-clonic seizure frequency on LCM.\u2022All 7 patients remained seizure free for > 1 year, and 2 of them for > 5 years.\u2022In 2 of the 9 patients, both with Juvenile Absence Epilepsy, absences aggravated.\u2022One aggravation consisted on a myoclonia and absence status, in a patient with no history of myoclonia.\u2022VEEG paralleled clinical improvement but didn't change in a case of absence worsening."},
